--- !u!114 &1265563552
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1265563550}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fdfa092efa898c343a082196a0ef2bee, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueTree:
  - dialogueText: Oh thank the heavens! You are not one of those ungodly creatures...
      They are everywhere! Roaming in their lifeless husks, just a caricature of
      men they once were... Gods...
    nextIndex: 1
    newFirstLine: 0
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect: []
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: "Ah, forgive my poor manners\u2026 My name is Amelia and I'm a
      nun, but also a candidate to become a vicar of our parish\u2026 As He wills,
      so I rejoice."
    nextIndex: 2
    newFirstLine: 0
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect: []
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: I am a part of a rescue mission organised by The Evangelists in
      order to find Father Williams, t-the pastor of our parish... We stopped here
      to rest and some of stronger men headed deeper into the forest to scout. Just
      moments later we heared their screams...
    nextIndex: 3
    newFirstLine: 0
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect: []
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: I waited here since... They just... Turned... Into those... Weird
      creatures... They don't notice me anymore and it seems that their minds have
      been shattered... Yet I refuse to leave without finding Father Williams. I
      do not know you stranger, but you are my only hope. Will you help me?
    nextIndex: -1
    newFirstLine: 0
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9afeb72b23c12d144a9191090189dee0, type: 2}
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: May The Maker bless you! I am just a nun and can't aid you in battle,
      but I can sell you some items that were left in the camp if you desire. Forgive
      me, but I cannot gift them for free, even though I wish to do so, as alas our
      law forbids it.
    nextIndex: -1
    newFirstLine: 6
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect: []
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: B-But please... I-I... Well... You are right, it is quite unreasonable
      for me to ask you to face those... Unholy... Creatures... Well... I will stay
      here. Nevertheless... If you stumble upon any track of Father Williams... Please
      let me know.
    nextIndex: -1
    newFirstLine: 8
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect: []
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: Would you like to purchase some of our trinkets? They will surely
      appear usefull.
    nextIndex: -1
    newFirstLine: 7
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec05a692a9aa0b24fbca4416888fd9f5, type: 2}
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: Stranger! Have you found something out yet? O-Or maybe you wish
      to purchase something...? Speak what's on your mind.
    nextIndex: -1
    newFirstLine: 0
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec05a692a9aa0b24fbca4416888fd9f5, type: 2}
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: Stranger? You are still here...? Please be carefull, it is not
      safe here... Don't stay in these woods too long...
    nextIndex: -1
    newFirstLine: 0
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5ec2e7a571ee62c47a6b1612259efb58, type: 2}
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: This is his cross! So it is true that he run off to somewhere here...
      Listen. The truth is that... Father Williams... Started to change... He started
      to morph into this... Strange creature. He seemed to be in great pain while
      doing so. The very cross you hold in your hand caught on fire on his neck.
      Yet it didn't burn. That all happend in front of my own eyes...
    nextIndex: 10
    newFirstLine: 0
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect: []
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: The Evangelists came here to slaughter him... And I volounteered
      in hope to find him alive and well... I am servant of out Lord and I despise
      some of their methods. But... If he remained that visious beast... Kill him.
      Please.
    nextIndex: 11
    newFirstLine: 0
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect: []
    itemsToGive: []
  - dialogueText: Keep the cross. It seems to cause uncomfort to this blasphemous
      vermin... And... Take this. It was forbidden to use such cruel weapons years
      ago... But I think we don't have a choice do we?
    nextIndex: -1
    newFirstLine: 12
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7836ac919ec312542a48f5a5119f23b5, type: 2}
    itemsToGive:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 783eddec4fcadb4478849d2d66f63bb7, type: 2}
  - dialogueText: Something caught your eye?
    nextIndex: -1
    newFirstLine: 0
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    effect:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcdd5054c6197204bab2421b5e9d75c6, type: 2}
    itemsToGive: []
